<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezra</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ezra</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow aming tukah dowi chekhai; nachepaw Ezra ruiah mih naown kown mih sakowmra uowi. Tawkche Ezra klen kowi paw arui mih nauowi ne tak kown mih sakowmra uowi chekhai. Now mami bowih rui khin dow 456-444 BC takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih dow Israeluüa kowh lümla hai kawngmu pra kowh lawnguan bowih chekhai. Mami bowih kowi kowh pankrima mih powik dow 9-10 lawng chekhai. Nakowi dow Jihudi nadowi miuüa hown tapün talo mih angak chekhai pami lawnguan kowi Ezra tüngsang khai, now maru-uüa mih amatni kowh angak taphuang khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ezra uown mih dow krungchakuüa chur mih hownia chekhai. Mami bowih dow tali bak kowi sum bak mih Hebrai lai hown ruiah khai. Tawkche chowra lawnguan kowi kowh charam dow Aramuüa lai hown ruiah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami khin khe kowh chowra pra kowh cha rui müa laiklow dow Aramuüa lai hown chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ezra bowih ruiah mih dow Babulawn pren hownia amatni pren kowi Jihudiuüa uang plan khe chekhai. Uang rik plan mih Jihudi thumchak dow Zerubabel kruitownra krüa kowi kowh Filistin pren kowi chekhai (1-6 lawng).</para>
  <para style="ip">Amatni dow ransu-uüa lainowmma hangah mih luk kowi phuchuara hai Thurai chup kim mih thawp büah khai. Nami khin khe risi Hagai hai risi Zekaria iüah mih amatni kowi lainowmma peah süngürra khai. Taruk hownia raiat lawng mowr kowi kowh akhin dow 58 ning mowr chekhai. Esther mangma uowila mih dow nami khin khe chekhai. Now 458 BC khe Ezra kruitownra krüa kowi Jihudiuüa mih takhangra hownia Jerusalem kowi uang plan mang pathum khai iawk (7-10 lawng).</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Kimping namkhetuüa: Kimping namkhetuüa pami dow kowmatia kim ria kim ret kowi kowh uowi mih kimchakuüa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Urim hai Thumim: Urim hai Thumim pami dow owngphowr kowi kowh towah mih achachow mih uanh chekhai. Nami dow hua chünchü singh chünchü miapaw tuk kaneu dowi chekhai. Nami dow Thurai naukrang natukla kownkow uamow lang kri mih tawngah mih uanh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Mangmu: Mangmu pami dow kim dawng towng ning towng kowmatia pren mang kowi chepaw chowra kowi chepaw ari aiang kowi uowi khowt pe tangka pawisa mih kowi kowh tek pe mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Zerubabel kruitownra krüa kowi cham takhang miuüa Jerusalem kowi uang plan mih 1:1-6:22</para>
  <para style="io1">Ezra kruitownra krüa kowi cham takhang miuüa Jerusalem kowi uang plan mih 7:1-10:44</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s1">Pren kowi Judauüa uang plan mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />Persia pren kowi Kuras uown chowm mang mih ning khe risi Jeremia tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow uang tachih khai bowt. CHAKRAMANG peah saktuak rakowi Kuras dow mami laiklow ruiah hanow aia kowh pren maten kowi maiawng krawi phuang khai:<verse eid="EZR 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />“Mami dow Persia pren mang ang Kuras kowh ana pek chekhai. Palusama luk kowi pe chowm ang mang mih dow CHAKRAMANG mukuang kowi kowh Thurai chekhai. Aia dow Juda pren kowi kowh Jerusalem marow kowi aia vüi nathawp pe kim lowk kown mih kurdik pe ang khai. <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" />Naiawng rakowi enni Thurai maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai kim chang kown nau miuüa dow Juda pren kowi kowh Jerusalem marow kowi pacham kowi lah, now nakowi dow CHAKRAMANG Thurai kim mih pacham chang lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi dow Thurai mih uowi reng chekhai. Nakowi kowkowi miuüa tut-e dow amatni kowh Thurai mih pacham tawi uowi reng lah. <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />Lowra kowi cham uowi mih Thurai maru Israeluüa che Jerusalem marow kowi plan kown nau khai hanow naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow amatni kowh kimping namkhetuüa mih kuh, tai, uanh hai tawncher ün nakrawi peah kown takla. Nami klen kowi Jerusalem marow kowi Thurai chup kim chang müa amatni sak nau hown nakrawi pe uanh kown mih paw tek pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZR 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />Nahanow Juda hai Benjamin krungchak aluchowuüa, uamowuüa hai Leviuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh Thurai peah saktuak miuüa dow Jerusalem marow kowi nakowchang CHAKRAMANG kim kownkow kamrüt khai bowt. <verse eid="EZR 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" />Now amatni kimping namkhetuüa dow amatni kowi kuh uanh, tai uanh, akeng mih uanh, tawncher hai asung khakma mih uanh ün hown krawi khowngah khai. Nami klen kowi kowmatia sak nau hown kowh uanh pek paw krawi peah büah khai. <verse eid="EZR 1:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7-8" />Mang Nebuknezar mih aia chowm mang khe Jerusalem marow kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kim hownia uanh maten pawla hanow aia kowh thurai chup kim kowi towah khai. Naiawngün uanh dow Nebuknezar kowh thurai kim hownia Kuras mih aia kowh dawngthawnguan chawng mih Mithredat kowi uang pe lawtta khai. Now Mithredat dow naiawngün uanh mih rüaah hanow Juda pren kruitown mih Sesbazar rut kowi ap pe khai. <verse eid="EZR 1:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />Naiawngün uanh dow kuh lawngpan 30 klüng, tai lawngpan 1,000 klüng, tai puh 29 klüng, <verse eid="EZR 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />kuh bia chah 30 klüng, now akeng mih uanh 1,000 klüng chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />Kuh hai tai uanh dow bowkbowk kowi 5,400 klüng chekhai. Naiawngün uanh dow Babulawn pren kowi kowh cham <char style="w">takhangra</char> hownia Jerusalem marow kowi maru kawmuüa uang plan khe kowh Sesbazar uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s">Nar hownia uang plan miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />Maiawngünuüa dow Babulawn pren kowi cham takhangra hownia kowh uang plan miuüa ming chekhai. Amatni dow Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar chowm mang khe khümla now Babulawn pren kowi pawla mih maru-uüa chekhai. Amatni dow nami hownia uang lawt hanow Jerusalem marow hai Juda pren kowi kowh amatni chowlowkkow krungchakuüa uowi rah marow hai kua kowi uang uowi büah khai. <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />Maiawngün uang lawt mih thum kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow Zerubabel, Jesua, Nehemia, Seraia, Relaia, Mawrdekai, Bilsan, Mispar, Bigvai, Rehum hai Bana büah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 2:2">Chowlowkkow krungchak tut-e uang plan mih Israel chenchap kachakuüa maru iun dow maiawng. <verse eid="EZR 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />Paraws krungchak hownia 2,172 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />Sefatia krungchak hownia 372 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />Ara krungchak hownia 775 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />Pahat-Moab chuprek chaprek Jesua hai Joab krungchak hownia 2,812 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />Elam krungchak hownia 1,254 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />Zatu krungchak hownia 945 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />Zakai krungchak hownia 760 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />Bani krungchak hownia 642 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />Bebai krungchak hownia 623 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />Azgad krungchak hownia 1,222 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />Adonikam krungchak hownia 666 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />Bigvai krungchak hownia 2,056 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />Adin krungchak hownia 454 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />Ater krungchak hownia 98 ia (Ater dow Hezekia chekhai), <verse eid="EZR 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />Bezai krungchak hownia 323 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />Jora krungchak hownia 112 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />Hasum krungchak hownia 223 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />now Gibar krungchak hownia 95 ia chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />Chowlowkkow pipu-uüa kowh marow kowi uang plan mih maru iun dow maiawng. Bethlehem marow kowi 123 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />Netofa marow kowi 56 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />Anathawt marow kowi 128 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />Azmavet marow kowi 42 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />Kiriat-Jearim, Kefira hai Berawt marow kowi 743 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />Rama hai Geba marow kowi 621 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />Mikmas marow kowi 122 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />Bethel hai Ai marow kowi 223 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />Nebo marow kowi 52 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />Magbis marow kowi 30 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" />satkup pra kowh Elam marow kowi 1,254 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />Harim marow kowi 320 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />Lawd marow, Hadid marow hai Ono marow kowi 725 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />Jeriko marow kowi 345 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />now Sena marow kowi 3,630 ia chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Uang plan mih uamowuüa maru iun dow maiawng. Jesua chuprek chaprek Jedaia krungchak hownia 973 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />Imer krungchak hownia 1,052 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />Pasur krungchak hownia 1,247 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />Harim krungchak hownia 1,017 ia chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Levi chenchap hownia kowh uang plan mih maru iun dow maiawng. Hodavia chuprek chaprek Jesua hai Kadmiel krungchak hownia 74 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" />meng sara Asaf krungchak hownia 128 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" />kangchawng mih Salum, Ater, Talmawn, Akub, Hatita hai Sobai krungchak hownia 139 ia chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" />Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang mih uang plan miuüa dow Ziha kowh krungchakuüa, Hasufa kowh krungchakuüa, Tabaawt kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="EZR 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />Keraws kowh krungchakuüa, Siaha kowh krungchakuüa, Padawn kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="EZR 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />Lebana kowh krungchakuüa, Hagaba kowh krungchakuüa, Akub kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="EZR 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />Hagab kowh krungchakuüa, Salmai kowh krungchakuüa, Hanan kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="EZR 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />Gidel kowh krungchakuüa, Gahar kowh krungchakuüa, Reaia kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="EZR 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />Rezin kowh krungchakuüa, Nekoda kowh krungchakuüa, Gazam kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="EZR 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />Uza kowh krungchakuüa, Pasea kowh krungchakuüa, Besai kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="EZR 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />Asna kowh krungchakuüa, Meunim kowh krungchakuüa, Nefisim kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="EZR 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />Bakbuk kowh krungchakuüa, Hakufa kowh krungchakuüa, Harhur kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="EZR 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />Bazlut kowh krungchakuüa, Mehida kowh krungchakuüa, Harsa kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="EZR 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />Barkaws kowh krungchakuüa, Sisera kowh krungchakuüa, Tema kowh krungchakuüa, <verse eid="EZR 2:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />Nezia kowh krungchakuüa hai Hatifa kowh krungchak büah chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 2:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" />Mang Sawlawmawn kowh nar krungchak uang plan miuüa dow Sotai krungchakuüa, Hasoferet krungchakuüa, Peruda krungchakuüa, <verse eid="EZR 2:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />Jala krungchakuüa, Darkawn krungchakuüa, Gidel krungchakuüa, <verse eid="EZR 2:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />Sefatia krungchakuüa, Hatil krungchakuüa, Pokeret-Hazebaim krungchakuüa hai Ami krungchakuüa chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 2:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang mih hai mang Sawlawmawn kowh naruüa dow bowkbowk kowi 392 ia chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 2:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59-60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59-60" />Nami klen kowi Tel-Mela marow, Tel-Harsa marow, Cherub marow, Adan marow hai Imer marow kowi kowh Delaia krungchak, Tobia krungchak hai Nekoda krungchak maru paw uang tawi plan 652 ia chekhai. Tawkche amatni dow amatni Israel chenchap pami amatra tawngpaw nowng tüng büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 2:59-60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" />Uamow kowh krungchak hownia uang plan miuüa dow Hobaia krungchak, Hakawz krungchak hai Barzilai krungchak büah chekhai. (Barzilai dow Gilead süng kowi kowh Barzilai chama hown tachawng khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh ming paw naiawng rükah mih chekhai). <verse eid="EZR 2:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" />Amatni dow ming tang bowih kowi amatni kowh ming krawi cham büah chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw krawi ka cham büah dowi chekhai. Naiawng kowh amatni dow asürlawkma chekhai rakowi uamow lup hownia tabat takla khai. <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" />Now Juda pren kruitown mih dow Urim hai Thumim pami hown CHAKRAMANG tut-e uamow lünta dowi mowr changla phuchua mih uanh maten nacha dowi kown mih amatni kowi tek pe khai.<verse eid="EZR 2:63" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Juda pren kowi kowh uang plan mih maru iun dow bowkbowk kowi 42,360 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />nami klen kowi amatni kowh narla hai narma dow 7,337 ia, masiuüa kachakuüa meng sara dow 200 ia, <verse eid="EZR 2:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />kawrnga dow 736 pum, kawrngaramchük chah dow 245 pum, <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />ut dow 435 pum, now kawrngaramchük dow 6,720 pum chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 2:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Akung kowi naiawngün uang plan miuüa hownia Jerusalem kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi uang büah ne khai. Nakhowk khe krungchak kowi kowh tawngbak mih aluchowuüa dow Jerusalem kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG chup kim nam prim kowi naplan thawp CHAKRAMANG kim sar kownkow amatni sak nau hown pe uanh khai. <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />Amatni dow ia mowr chi pe tangka pawisa khai. Amatni kowh uanpek dow bowkbowk kowi kuh 500 set, tai 2,830 set hai uamowuüa vüi kowrmow bawngthawngma mih 100 theng chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 2:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />Uamowuüa, Leviuüa, meng sarauüa, kangchawng miuüa, Thurai chup kim lup chang miuüa dow Jerusalem marow re-e kowh kua kowi uowi büah khai. Now iawngpa mih Israeluüa dow Jerusalem marow re-e kowh kua kowi ne, now amatni chowlowkkow pipu-uüa kowh marow kowi ne krawi uowi khai.<verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s">Plan thawp phuchuara mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />Ranit la kung kowi dow Israeluüa maten mih amatni chowlowkkow kua hai marow kowi ia uowi büah khai bowt. Nakhowk khe amatni dow Jerusalem marow kowi takua talawm büah bowk khai. <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" />Nami khin khe amatni dow tikah mih uanap chang müa Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi plan thawp phuchuara lowk khai. Nami phuchuara dow Mosi kowi Thurai peah mih rirow bowih kowi arui uowi iawng plan thawpah büah khai. Nami phuchuara thawp miuüa dow Jozadak kowh chapa Jesua hown aia kowh auiua uamowuüa hai Sealtiel kowh chapa Zerubabel hown aia kowh auiuauüa chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" />Amatni dow hawt iawng uowi mih aria aret kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa kowi kram chepaw phuchuara nam prim luk kowi nami phuchuara mih plan thawp büah khai. Now nami phuchuara kowi dow rau-e hai iak pra kowh phuchua khin khe CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap pawi chang büah khai bowt. <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" />Nami kung kowi dow rirow bowih kowi arui uowi iawng chang <char style="w">Te Pawi</char> büah khai, now ni towng kowh vüi khowm bowkta mowr chi tawncher hown tikah mih uanap pawi chang büah khai. <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" />Nami hownia bowt now ni towng kowh tikah mih uanap, Lacher Pawi kowi kowh tikah mih uanap, CHAKRAMANG vüi khowmta bowkta mih pawi kowi kowh tikah mih uanap hai kowmatia sak nau hown kowh uang pawla mih uanap pawi chang büah khai. <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Naiawng hai amatni dow ranit la kowi kowh lacher pani hownia CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap pawi chang büah khai. Tawkche nami khin khe paw CHAKRAMANG chup kim vüi kimchüng khowm padow phükah dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Plan tarowng Thurai chup kim thawp mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" />Amatni dow Persia pren mang Kuras alow pek iawng Lebanawn hownia Jawpa mowr sata iawng uang pawla sidar singh mih Sur hai Sidawnuüa kowi dow chakkham, grep tui hai kanrawn sau peah khai. Now kim chang sarauüa hai singh hown kowh uanh thawp sarauüa kowi dow peah tangka büah khai.<verse eid="EZR 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />Now amatni dow Babulawn pren hownia uang plan kowh Jerusalem kowi uang uowi mih laitali la khe Thurai chup kim chang tarowng büah khai. Nakhowk khe kowh chang lup miuüa dow Sealtiel kowh chapa Zerubabel, Jozadak kowh chapa Jesua hai amatni kowh tainau-uüa chekhai. Amatni kowh tainau-uüa dow uamowuüa, Leviuüa hai cham takhangra hownia Jerusalem kowi uang plan mih maten chekhai. Now pirmi ning hownia nami luk kowi kowh Leviuüa kowi dow Thurai chup kim lup chang miuüa kowi mingkhet mih kurdik peah khai. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" />Thurai chup kim lup chang miuüa kowi mingkhet miuüa dow Jesua hai achapauüa, atainau-uüa, Hodavia krungchak Kadmiel hai achapauüa, Hanadad chapauüa hai amatni kowh tainau-uüa chekhai. Amatni dow Levi chenchap kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />Now kim chang sarauüa CHAKRAMANG kim vüi phük kimchüng mih khin khe uamowuüa hai Leviuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh Asaf chapauüa dow chowlowkkow iowngra kowi iowng büah khai. Nakhowk khe Israel mang David kowh ana pek iawng CHAKRAMANG kowi nakiowrila kownkow uamowuüa dow amatni kowh amülüng mih tawnguat khupla now dowkla baw khai, now Asaf chapauüa dow dowkla klingchow khai. <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" />Now amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi hai tek awmrawm lai se maiawng tek meng büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 3:11">“CHAKRAMANG dow aiungma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 3:11">Israeluüa luk kowi aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow anikma chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 3:11">CHAKRAMANG kowh kim vüi phükta kimchüng khowk rakowi nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa dow atünma how se CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsiah khai. <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" />Nachenganchepaw naiawng awmrawm rakowi howla sawm khe alai kowh Thurai chup kim khi mih uamow lawngtanguüa, Leviuüa hai krungchak aluchowuüa dow Thurai chup kim kimchüng phükta mih khita hanow atün atünma kar khai. <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowh how klow hai kar klow dow tawng mih chow how klow hai tawng mih chow kar klow pami tuktaah dowi chekhai. Nami klow dow alakma hownia khowm padow ia ta khai.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s">Pe thawpah Thurai chup kim dowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Babulawn prenchakuüa khümla mih hownia uang plan miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi plan tarowng thawp Thurai chup kim khai. Nami satang dow Judauüa hai Benjamin maru-uüa kowh ransu-uüa mih tawi ta khai. <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" />Naiawng rakowi ransu-uüa dow Zerubabel hai krungchak aluchowuüa tut-e kowkowi hanow tek pe mih, “Anging paw enni hown tawi taiua chang Thurai chup kim kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow makowi Asuria pren mang Esarhadawn uang pawla anging hownia now anging paw enni chupiiaah mih Thurai kowi tawi chupiia reng, now Thurai vüi tawncher phuchua paw anging chang reng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZR 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" />Nachenganchepaw Zerubabel, Jesua hai Israel krungchak aluchowuüa tek pe amatni mih, “Anging kowh Thurai vüi nathawp Thurai chup kim kown mih kowi tawngpaw enni tawi chang lakke dowi. Nami Thurai chup kim dow Persia pren mang Kuras ana pek iawng CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi anging ngetchow taih nathawp kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="EZR 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Nakhowk khe nami pren kowi kowh uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa dow nami Thurai chup kim thawp pacham taingta lah pakowh Juda maru-uüa kowi piakta pe süngürra khai, now krawkah büah khai. <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />Naiawngün ransu-uüa dow Persia pren mang kowh maru iukuüa kowi peah <char style="w">bümsua</char> hanow Juda-uüa kowh kamrütra mih taingta pe khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow Persia pren kowi Kuras chowm mang khe hai Darius chowm mang khe naiawng chang büah chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Artazerzes kowi sak pe cha mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />Mang Darius chapa Ahasuer uown chowm mang mih khin khe naiawngün ransu-uüa dow Juda hai Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi kingküala kownkow mang tut-e rui chasak lowk khai.<verse eid="EZR 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" />Nami akrama kung kowi mang Ahasuer chapa Artazerzes chowm mang mih khin khe paw Bislam, Mithredat, Tabel hai amatni kowh auiuauüa mih mang tut-e plan rui pe chasak lowk khai. Nami chasak dow Aramaik lai hown amatni ruiah khai, now akung kowi dow mang natuktala kownkow plan pe büah khai. <verse eid="EZR 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Kruitown mih Rehum hai cha rui mih Simsai iüah dow Jerusalem marow kowi kingküala mih lawnguan mang Artazerzes tut-e rui chasak khai. <verse eid="EZR 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />Amatchi ruiah mih chasak kowi tawi tangi miuüa dow tara chet miuüa, aluchowuüa, maru iukuüa, Erekuüa, Babulawnuüa, Susa marow kowi kowh Elamuüa, <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" />now Samari marow hai Iufratis aw satkup pra kowh süng kowi kowh ringkaw uowima mih Asurbanipal towah mih maru-uüa chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />Nami chasak kowi kowh arui uowi mih dow maiawng,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 4:11" />
  <para style="mi" vid="EZR 4:11">“Artazerzes mangkri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 4:11">“Auown kowi anging rik chup en. Anging dow Iufratis aw satkup prakowi kowh uowi mih en kowh naruüa chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" />Anging pe tuk en kown mih lawnguan uowi ne. En pren hownia kowh uang lawt mih Jihudiuüa Jerusalem marow kowi uang uowi büah khai, now amatni dow kingküa dawma hai angakma mih marow plan thawp büah khai. Nami marow kowi kowh achüng hai tap ün paw plan raw büah khai iawk. <verse eid="EZR 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" />Nami marow hai tap ki thawpta bowk khe dow amatni mih tawng iawng mih mangmu paw nape en kown nadowi pami anging pe tuk pe ta en kown nau. Naiawng amatni pe mangmu dowi hanow mang kowh tangka pawisa kakra tia dow napiak kown.<verse eid="EZR 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />“Anging dow en nimkrüa kowi kowh uowi mih maru-uüa chekhai. En luk kowi naiawng rukraira uang ting kown mih anging nau dowi. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün laiklow anging uang krawi phowng en khai. <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />En kowh pipu-uüa ruila mih bowih kowi Jerusalem marow lawnguan nakrawi cham kownkow anging nau en khai. Nahanow nami bowih kowi dow Jerusalem marow kingküa dawma mih lawnguan en nakhi kown. Nami klen kowi achük alai hownia manguüa hai pren kruitown miuüa kowi nami marow kingküa reng mih lawnguan paw en nakhi kown taih. Nami marow piakta mih dow naiawng rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Nami Jerusalem marow hai tap che amatni ki thawpta khowk hanow Iufratis aw satkup pra kowh süng ün en namata kown towbowt pami anging pe tuk en kown nau,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZR 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Mang Artazerzes krawi rui pe chasak mih dow maiawng,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 4:17" />
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 4:17">“Kruitown mih Rehum, mang kowh cha rui mih Simsai, now Samari marow kowi kowh maru-uüa hai Iufratis aw satkup prakowi kowh maru-uüa, enni bowkbowk kowi ang chup enni. <verse eid="EZR 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />Enni uang krawi sak ang mih cha dow achima phat ang khowk. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />Jerusalem marow lawnguan kowi nakrawi lünta kownkow ang kowh maru-uüa kowi ang peah ana khowk. Nahanow nami marow dow achük alai hownia manguüa kowi kingküaah reng pami ang tuk khowk. Nakowi kowh maru-uüa dow lai üa kürma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" />Akürma mih manguüa dow Jerusalem marow kowi uowi büah khai. Nami marow hownia amatni dow Iufratis aw satkup pra kowh arah maten kruitown büah khai. Nakowi kowh maru-uüa dow naiawngün manguüa kowi lowra mih mangmu peah reng chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />“Ang peah ana dowi matchang nami marow amatni naia thawp kown nadowi. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh lup nataingta kownkow kawmat kowtek pe büa diah. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Nami lawnguan kowi mapaw hangkow nawknai büa diah. Ang napiak kown mih mapaw ang nau dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZR 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Mang Artazerzes kowh chasak dow Rehum, Simsai hai amatchi kowh maru iukuüa kowi phat pe khai. Nami tata hown krowksang amatni dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Jihudiuüa tut-e kowkowi khai, now Jihudiuüa kowh lup dow kür hown kowtaingta pe büah khai.<verse eid="EZR 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />Naiawng hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Thurai chup kim thawp dow taing khai bowt. Jihudiuüa mih nami Thurai chup kim mih Persia pren mang Darius chowm mang mih pre ning mowr nowng thawp büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="s">Mang Darius kowi sak pe cha mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />Nami khin khe risi Hagai hai Ido krungchak risi Zekaria iüah mih Israeluüa kowh Thurai ming hown Juda pren kowi kowh akeng mih marow hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Judauüa tut-e kowtek Thurai lai khai. <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" />Nami risi pre ia laiklow tata hanow Sealtiel kowh chapa Zerubabel hai Jozadak kowh chapa Jesua iüah mih Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Thurai chup kim chang plan tarowng khai iawk. Nakhowk khe nami risi pre ia paw amatni kowi tawi khowngah khai.<verse eid="EZR 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" />Nami khin khe Iufratis aw satkup pra kowh pren kruitown mih Tatenai, Sethar-Bozenai hai akeng mih maru iukuüa dow Judauüa tut-e uang khai. Now Judauüa kowi amatni uang lüntaah mih, “Nathawp Thurai chup kim iawk kown mih ana mia chow pe enni? <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Mami kim chang miuüa ming maten tek anging madiah,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" />Nachenganchepaw Judauüa kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa prakowi Thurai mih pela ching reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi mang Darius tut-e chasak kowting dowi mowr, now Darius hownia kowh chasak plan uang ting dowi mowr dow Persia pren aluchowuüa mih Judauüa kowi nami kim chang taingta pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6-7" />Mang Darius tut-e Iufratis aw satkup pra kowh pren kruitown mih Tatenai, Sethar-Bozenai hai akeng mih maru iukuüa krawi rui pe chasak mih dow maiawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 5:6-7">“Aw mangkri Darius, aiungma en pacham uowi reng lah!<verse eid="EZR 5:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />“Aw mangkri, en pacham tuk lah pakowh mami chasak anging uang krawi sak en mih chekhai. Juda pren kowi kowh lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai chup kim kowi anging kowkowi chowdiah. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa mih aiuk aiukma mih hua hown thawp Thurai chup kim thüm, now kimbang luk kowi klowng paw tangta büah khowk chekhai. Nami Thurai chup kim dow towsakma hown thawpah büah khai, now nami lup dow chawn paw chawn khai.<verse eid="EZR 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" />“Nakhowk khe, ‘Nami Thurai chup kim naplan chang iawk kown mih ana mia chow pe enni,’ padow lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi anging lüntaah khai. <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Amatni kowi naiawng anging lüntaah mih dow amatni kowh aluchowuüa ming anging nauang tek en kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" />“Nakhowk khe amatni klang anging mih, ‘Anging dow mukuang pren hai lusa thawp mih Thurai kowh naruüa chekhai. Alai kowh anging pipu-uüa chowng khe Israel manguüa pungmadawng kowi lang kri lang kraing mih mang uowi lowk ia. Nami mang mih aia chowng khe thawpla Thurai chup kim lowk. Kawmat kowh mami Thurai chup kim anging thawp mih dow nami chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" />Nachenganchepaw nakhowk khe kowh anging pipu-uüa dow mukuang Thurai kowi towkah kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow Babulawn pren mang Kaldai chenchap Nebuknezar rut kowi Thurai ap-ah khai. Nami khin khe Nebuknezar mih mami Thurai chup kim piakta naknak khai, now maru kawmuüa kowi dow khümla now Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. <verse eid="EZR 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" />Nachenganchepaw Babulawn pren kowi Kuras uown chowm mang mih ning khe aia dow mami Thurai chup kim naplan thawp kownkow pe anging ana khai. <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" />Nami klen kowi Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Thurai chup kim hownia Nebuknezar pawla mih kuh hai tai hown kowh uanh maten paw aia mih Babulawn pren kowi kowh akeng thuraiuüa chup kim hownia lawtta khai. Now naiawngün uanh dow mang Kuras mih Juda pren kruitown mih Sesbazar rut kowi peah khai. <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />Aia kowi dow Jerusalem marow kowi alai kowh Thurai chup kim nam kowi naplan thawp Thurai chup kim iawk kownkow mang Kuras tek pe khai, now naiawngün uanh mih nami Thurai chup kim kowi natowah kownkow tek pe khai. <verse eid="EZR 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" />Naiawng rakowi Sesbazar dow Jerusalem marow kowi uangah now uang uown phük Thurai chup kim kimchüng khai. Nami ni hownia ani mowr pat nami Thurai chup kim lup dow chang reng tak, now kawmat pat chur dowi tak chekhai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="EZR 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />“Naiawng rakowi aw mangkri, Jerusalem kowi kowh mami Thurai chup kim nathawp kown mih ana charam mang Kuras pe nowm chünchü mih en che tuk kown nau hanow Babulawn manguüa lawnguan kowi arui uowi mih chabowih towk rah kim kowi en naia mü kown. Nami kung kowi nami lawnguan kowi tawng iawng chow en ka tuak mih uang krawi phowk anging diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s">Mang Darius ana hown krawi cham charam mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Now Thurai chup kim thawp lawnguan kowi kowh arui uowi mih charam nakrawi cham kownkow mang Darius mih lawt ana khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh maru-uüa dow Babulawn pren kowi manguüa kowh charam towk rah kowi nami charam kowkrawi cham khai. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" />Nahanow amatni dow Babulawn pren kowi kowh Mediauüa kowh Ekbatana pami marow kri kowi tuata hüah mih charam kowka lowk khai. Nami charam kowi arui uowi mih dow maiawng:</para>
  <para style="d" vid="EZR 6:2">Ana pek mat müa charam.<verse eid="EZR 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" />“Mang Kuras uown chowm mang mih ning khe aia dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Thurai chup kim thawp lawnguan kowi maiawng lawt ana khai: Nachangla tawncher phuchua kownkow Thurai chup kim mih pacham thawp iawk lah. Nami Thurai chup kim dow akhawtma pacham thawpah lah. Nami kim dow akro hai adowng phia 60 muk chi pacham thawpah lah. <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" />Nami kim ping müa dow aiuk aiukma mih hua sum tan mih luk kowi pacham tow pe singh patan chi lah. Nami kim chang charek maten dow mang hownia pacham peah lah. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" />Nami klen kowi Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Thurai chup kim hownia Babulawn pren kowi mang Nebuknezar uang pawla mih kuh hai tai hown kowh uanh maten paw Jerusalem kowi kowh Thurai chup kim kowi atowk rah kowi pacham towah iawk lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZR 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Darius kowh chasak plan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />Nakhowk khe mang Darius dow uang krawi sak pe cha miuüa kowi maiawng krawi plan rui pe chasak khai,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 6:6">“Iufratis aw satkup pra kowh pren kruitown mih Tatenai, Sethar-Bozenai hai maru iukuüa low, enni mih kawmat nami Thurai chup kim hownia cham lang tahen büa diah. <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />Nami Thurai chup kim lup chang kowi hangkow tawi hang büah. Judauüa kowh kruitown mih hai amatni kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa mih alai kowh Thurai chup kim nam kowi pacham thawp Thurai chup kim iawk lah. <verse eid="EZR 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />Nami klen kowi Judauüa kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi nami Thurai chup kim chang enni natawi khowngah kownkow ang krawi pe enni ana chekhai. Nami lup nataing dowi kownkow nami lup chang miuüa kowi achima enni napeah charek reng kown takla. Nami charek dow Iufratis aw satkup pra kowh uowi miuüa mangmu hownia enni napeah kown. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />Mukuang Thurai vüi nachangla tikah mih uanap kownkow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uamowuüa kowi chiala powrchow, ruapurla, ruapur chah, püm, awisa, grep tui, sau hai lakke takla mih maten enni napeah kown takla. Naiawngün dow ni towng amatni lakke mowr chi enni napeah ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" />Mukuang Thurai awmrawmla iawng naia changla uanap pawi büah kownkow hai mang hai mang chapauüa iung müa vüi naia chupla Thurai büah kownkow naiawng enni natawi khowngah kown. <verse eid="EZR 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" />Nami klen kowi mami ang kowh ana pek chün dowi mih maru kowi dow nakowngta kown. Aia kowi dow aia kim kowi kowh klowng nachemah papra hanow taplawn pat nasawtah kown. Ang kowh ana pek chün dowi rakowi nami maru kowh kim dow mawngchawng kuakra nachangla pe kown. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" />Lowra mih mang hai lowra mih chenchap pana lah, mami ana pek chün dowi kowi Jerusalem marow kowi kowh nami Thurai chup kim piakta kown kamrüt khai hanow nami maru kowi dow nami Thurai chup kim kowi kowh uowi mih Thurai pacham piakah lah. Mami ana dow ang Darius hownia kowh pe mih chekhai. Mami ana dow enni nachünah kaneu kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki thawp Thurai chup kim mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Naiawng chasak hown mang Darius uang krawi pe ana mih khita hanow Iufratis aw satkup pra kowh pren kruitown mih Tatenai, Sethar-Bozenai hai nakowi kowh maru iukuüa dow nami ana pek mih kaneuma chünah khai. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" />Judauüa kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa dow thawp Thurai chup kim rengreng khai, now amatni dow Risi Hagai hai Ido krungchak Zekaria iüah Thurai lai hown peah süngürra mih hownia lang süngür ngamlam khai. Naiawng rakowi lawngtang aluchowuüa kowh dow lup chang uang chawn ngamlam khai. Nahanow amatni dow Israeluüa kowh Thurai ana pek, Persia mang Kuras kowh ana pek, mang Darius kowh ana pek hai Artazerzes kowh ana pek iawng nami Thurai chup kim thawp churta khai. <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" />Nami Thurai chup kim thawp chur mih dow mang Darius chowm mang mih taruk ning khe sum la kowi kowh sum ni khe chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />Nami kung kowi dow uamowuüa, Leviuüa hai cham takhangra hownia kowh uang plan mih Israeluüa maten apiawma hown ap Thurai chup kim khai. <verse eid="EZR 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" />Ap Thurai chup kim mih khin khe amatni dow chiala 100 pum, ruapurla 200 pum hai ruapur chah 400 pum hown chang phuchua büah khai. Nami klen kowi Israeluüa maten kowh angak lawt lük müa paw amatni krungchakuüa uowi iawng ruala 12 pum hown chang phuchua büah khai. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" />Now Mosi rirow bowih kowi arui uowi iawng Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Thurai chup kim kowi nachang lup kownkow uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowi athum athumchow bakah khai.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sun Takat Pawi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />Babulawn pren kowi cham takhangra hownia kowh uang plan mih maru maten dow lacher laitali ni mih ni khe sun Takat Pawi khai bowt. <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" />Nakhowk khe uamowuüa hai Leviuüa dow amatni kowh lup naia changla kownkow tachim tasai büah khai. Now amatni dow amatni matia vüi, cham takhangra hownia kowh uang plan mih maten vüi hai akeng mih uamowuüa vüi Takat Pawi vüi kowi kowh tawncher mih ngen büah khai. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" />Nakhowk khe Babulawn pren hownia kowh uang plan mih Israeluüa maten Takat Pawi kowi kowh chakkham ahawmsang taiua cha büah khai. Nakhowk khe akeng pren hownia uang tawi miuüa maten paw nami Takat Pawi kowi kowh chakkham tawi cha khai; amatni dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai nau iawng nauowi kown nau kowh asürlawkma mih akeng chenchapuüa hownia lang takra mih maten chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" />Amatni dow apiawma hown ranit ni mowr The pe tuah dowi mih kawm Pawi sun büah khai. Israel kowh Thurai mih nami Thurai chup kim lup kowi pacham tawi khowngah lah pakowh CHAKRAMANG dow Asuria pren mang kowi uang peah saktuak khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow lainowmma awmrawm khai.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi Ezra kowkowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />Naiawngün phaw mih khin akrama kung kowi Persia pren mang Artazerzes chowm mang mih khin khe Ezra dow Babulawn pren hownia Jerusalem marow kowi uang khai. Ezra kowh pa dow Seraia, Seraia kowh pa dow Azaria, Azaria kowh pa dow Hilkia, <verse eid="EZR 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />Hilkia kowh pa dow Salum, Salum kowh pa dow Zadawk, Zadawk kowh pa dow Ahitub, <verse eid="EZR 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />Ahitub kowh pa dow Amaria, Amaria kowh pa dow Azaria, Azaria kowh pa dow Meraiawt, <verse eid="EZR 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />Meraiawt kowh pa dow Zerahia, Zerahia kowh pa dow Uzi, Uzi kowh pa dow Buki, <verse eid="EZR 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />Buki kowh pa dow Abisua, Abisua kowh pa dow Finehas, Finehas kowh pa dow Eleazar, now Eleazar kowh pa dow uamow lang kri mih Arawn chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" />Ezra dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai peah mih ari aiang atukma mih kawngmu sara chekhai. Aia luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai prasira uowi reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow aia lü mih srui mang peah khai. Babulawn pren hownia uang lawt hanow Jerusalem marow kowi aia uang uowi mih dow mang Artazerzes chowm mang mih ranit ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />Now aia hown dow Israeluüa, uamowuüa, Leviuüa, meng sarauüa, Thurai chup kim chawng miuüa hai Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa mih uang tawi khai.<verse eid="EZR 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8-9" />Ezra luk kowi dow Thurai kowh saksing sanara tawi uowi reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow la uown kowi kowh lacher pani khe Babulawn pren hownia lawt hanow tanga la kowi kowh lacher pani khe Jerusalem marow kowi uang ting khai. <verse eid="EZR 7:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" />Ezra dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ari aiang nasang kown mih, nami ari aiang nachün kown mih, ari arow hai ana pek Israeluüa kowi natüngsang kown mih kowi hing tape khai.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezra kowi mang Artazerzes sak pe cha mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />Ezra dow uamow hai kawngmu sara chekhai. Aia dow Israel kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana pek hai rirow atukma chekhai. Akat khe mang Artazerzes dow Ezra kowi maiawng hai sak pe cha khai:<verse eid="EZR 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />“Ang manguüa kowh lang kri mih Artazerzes chekhai. Mami chasak dow uamow hai mukuang Thurai kowh ari aiang tüngsang mih Ezra kowi ang krawi sak pe mih chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />“Jerusalem marow kowi en plan mih khin khe ang pren kowi kowh uowi mih Israeluüa, uamowuüa hai Leviuüa tawi plan kown nau mih uowi khai ne hanow natawi ia plan kownkow kawmat ang peta ana khowk. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi Thurai kowh ari aiang chün tak chünchü mih en natukla kownkow ang hai ang kowh prengia pek mih ranit ia Jerusalem kowi kowchin en mih chowbowt. <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" />Now Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uowi mih Israel kowh Thurai vüi sak nau hown kowh anging peah mih kuh hai tai maten paw pawla diah.<verse eid="EZR 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" />“Nami klen kowi Babulawn pren hownia kowh en kala mih kuh maten hai tai maten pawla diah, now Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Thurai chup kim thawp müa vüi sak nau hown kowh Israeluüa hai uamowuüa krawi pe en mih srui paw pawla diah. <verse eid="EZR 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" />Naiawngün kuh hai tai hown dow chiala, ruapurla hai ruapur chah, kawmdi uanap hai hüngah mih uanap chang müa uanh ün ranla diah, now naiawngün dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh enni kowh Thurai kim kowi kowh phuchuara luk kowi changla phuchua diah. <verse eid="EZR 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />Now ta marat mih kuh hai tai hown dow en hai en tainau-uüa hown Thurai tut-e iung iawng changla büa diah.<verse eid="EZR 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />“Enni kowh Thurai chup kim kowi natawngah kownkow pe en mih puh bia aikam maten dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Thurai tut-e en nakowpawla kown. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Nami klen kowi enni kowh Thurai chup kim vüi lakke tak mih srui ang matia kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah hownia en napawla kown.<verse eid="EZR 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" />“Ang Artazerzes mih Iufratis aw pang satkup pra kowh dawngthawnguan chawng miuüa kowi ang peta ana khowk. Mukuang Thurai kowh rirow tüngsang mih uamow Ezra, en lü mih srui nape en kownkow amatni kowi ang tek pe khowk. <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />Amatni mih tai 3,400 set mowr, püm 18,000 set mowr, grep tui 2,200 set mowr, kanrawn sau 2,200 set mowr nape en kown, now awisa dow lakke takla mowr nape en kown. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Mukuang Thurai kowh ana pek iawng rowprowp Thurai chup kim vüi achang takla mih maten kaneuma en nachangah kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang hai ang chapauüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura nauang ting kown mih ang nau dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" />Nami klen kowi Thurai chup kim kowi kowh uamowuüa, Leviuüa, meng sarauüa, kangchawng miuüa hai Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa maten hownia tawng iawng mih mangmu paw napaw dowi kown mih amatni kowi ang tek pe khowk.<verse eid="EZR 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />“Ezra, en kowi dow Thurai pe en chanlaira khai. Nami chanlaira hown dow Iufratis aw satkup pra kowh uowi mih maru maten kowi nachet pe tara kownkow maru iukuüa hai tara chet miuüa kowi en natow pe kown. Tawkche naiawngün maru-uüa mih en kowh Thurai ari aiang natuk kown takla. Now Thurai ari aiang tuk dowi miuüa kowi dow en natüngsangah kown takla. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />En kowh Thurai ari aiang hai mang kowh ari aiang chün dowi miuüa kowi dow naripah ngengche kown takla. Nami ripra dow kowngta takla mih chepaw naia, pren hownia prütta takla mih chepaw naia, dawngthawnguan pawta pe takla mih chepaw naia, now thawngklak takla mih chepaw naia kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZR 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezra kiow Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" />CHAKRAMANG a-i pipu-uüa kowh Thurai dow akiow pacham uowi lah. Jerusalem marow kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kim kowi naiawng mang ringkaw mih dow Thurai peah saktuak kowh chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" />Thurai mih aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura tüng ang rakowi mang, mang kowh prengia pek miuüa hai mang kowh maru iukuüa pe ang ringkawra khai. CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai tawi uowila ang rakowi ang ka sakkraingra khai, now Israel aluchowuüa kowi dow Jerusalem marow kowi ang uang nowng pawla khai.<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem kowi Ezra hown uang plan mih aluchowuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Persia pren kowi Artazerzes chowm mang mih khin khe Babulawn pren hownia ang hown kowh Jerusalem marow kowi tawi plan mih machak aluchowuüa dow maiawngünuüa chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" />Finehas machak hownia Gersawm, Ithamar machak hownia Daniel, David machak hownia Hatus. <verse eid="EZR 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" />Paraws machak hownia Zekaria hai machak ming tang bowih kowi kowh ming rui uowi mih 150 ia. <verse eid="EZR 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />Pahat-Moab krungchak hownia Zerahia kowh chapa Eliehoenai hai aia hown kowh uang tawi mih 200 ia. <verse eid="EZR 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />Zatu krungchak hownia Jahaziel kowh chapa Sekania hai aia hown kowh uang tawi mih 300 ia. <verse eid="EZR 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />Adin krungchak hownia Jonathan kowh chapa Ebed hai aia hown kowh uang tawi mih 50 ia. <verse eid="EZR 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />Elam krungchakuüa pungmadawng hownia Athalia kowh chapa Jesaia hai aia hown kowh uang tawi mih 70 ia. <verse eid="EZR 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />Sefatia krungchak hownia Mikhael kowh chapa Zebadia hai aia hown kowh uang tawi mih 80 ia. <verse eid="EZR 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />Joab krungchak hownia Jehiel kowh chapa Obadia hai aia hown kowh uang tawi mih 218 ia. <verse eid="EZR 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />Bani krungchak hownia Josifia kowh chapa Selomit hai aia hown kowh uang tawi mih 160 ia. <verse eid="EZR 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />Bebai krungchak hownia Bebai kowh chapa Zekaria hai aia hown kowh uang tawi mih 28 ia. <verse eid="EZR 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />Azgad krungchak hownia Hakatan kowh chapa Johanan hai aia hown kowh uang tawi mih 110 ia. <verse eid="EZR 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />Adonikam krungchak hownia uang ta plan miuüa dow Elifelet, Jeuel, Semaia hai amatni hown kowh uang tawi mih 60 ia. <verse eid="EZR 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />Bigvai krungchak hownia Uthai, Zakur hai amatchi hown kowh uang tawi mih 70 ia chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tiama dawnglang khe kowplan haw Leviuüa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />Now Ahava marow pra kowh hawr mih aw re-e naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow arasang ang kuaah khai, now nami re-e mih khup tangbung hanow anging uowila sum ni khai. Nakhowk khe naiawngün maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi ang krawi mü pache iawngpa mih maru-uüa hai uamowuüa dow uowi chowdiah. Tawkche Leviuüa dow lowk ia paw uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />Naiawng rakowi nakhowk khe chanlaira uowima mih Joiarib hai Elnathan iüah hailawm aluchow Eliezer, Ariel, Semaia, Elnathan, Jarib, Elnathan, Nathan, Zekaria hai Mesulam büah kowi ang hawah khai. <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />Amatni kowi dow Kasifia marow kowi kowh Leviuüa kowh aluchow Ido tut-e ang kowchinah khai. Now anging kowh Thurai chup kim kowi nachang lup kown mih maru nauang krawi chin ne kownkow Ido hai Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang mih aia tainau-uüa kowi ang krawi tek pe khai.<verse eid="EZR 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" />Nakhowk khe anging kowh Thurai dow tawi uowila anging reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Ido hai aia tainau-uüa mih Serebia hai aia chapauüa hown tainau-uüa kowi uang krawi chin anging lairaiat ia khai. Serebia dow chanlaima mih maru chekhai. Aia dow Levi chenchap Mahli kowh krungchak chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19-20" />Nami klen kowi amatni dow Merari kowh krungchak Hasabia hai Jesaia, Jesaia kowh tainau-uüa hai chapauüa hailawm uang krawi chin anging pirmi ia khai, now Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa kowi paw uang krawi chin anging 220 ia khai. Naiawngün lup chang miuüa dow Leviuüa kowi natawi khowngah Thurai chup kim lup kownkow amatni pipu-uüa kowi David hai aia kowh maru iukuüa khowm bowkla mih chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa ming dow ming tang bowih kowi ruiah khai.<verse eid="EZR 8:19-20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />Nami kung kowi dow Ahava aw re-e uowi reng tak khe anging kowh Thurai pur kowi khamsum khamdawma nauowi kownkow hai nakhang hawm kownkow ang phuang khai. Naiawng ang phuang mih dow anging kowh chauüa hai dawngthawnguan maten aiungma anging naia mangla kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" />Tiama rawng kowi ransu-uüa rut hownia nakala anging kownkow khawk hown kowh mang mih siphaiuüa hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih siphaiuüa kowi mang hownia nalüla ne kown ang nau chowdiah. Tawkche ang rukrai khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow, “Thurai nau iawng chang miuüa kowi dow Thurai towkala reng. Tawkche aia kowi nuata miuüa luk kowi dow aia kowh kunmaraura uang kla reng chekhai,” pami mang kowi anging tekta pe khai bowt. <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Naiawng rakowi khang pe hawm khükhü Thurai tut-e anging awr lü awr leng khai, now aia dow anging awr lü mih iawng uang chang anging khai.<verse eid="EZR 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim vüi pe uanh mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />Nami kung kowi dow uamowuüa pungmadawng hownia aluchow laipre ia kowi ang kloah khai. Naiawngün aluchowuüa dow Serebia, Hasabia hai amatchi hown akeng mih uamow hamüt ia chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" />Now amatni kowi mih Thurai chup kim vüi mang hai aia kowh prengia pek miuüa, maru iukuüa hai nakowi kowh uowi mih Israeluüa pe mih kuh hai tai hown akeng mih uanh pek maten khaiah now ang peah khai. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />Amatni kowi ang peah mih dow tai 24,300<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">24,300 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami mami uan kowi kowh uanh ingsap maten Hebrai lai hown chim dowi chekhai.</char></note> set, tai hown kowh bia 3,400 set hai kuh 3,400 set chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />Nami klen kowi kuh hown kowh bia paw ang peah pirmi klüng khai; naiawngün dow bowkbowk kowi adik raiat set chekhai. Now kuh iawng asung khakma mih kri hown kowh bia klangiungma mih paw ang peah pre buk khai.<verse eid="EZR 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" />Amatni kowi ang tek pe mih, “Enni hai mami puh bia aikam maten dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaita mih chowbowt. Maiawngün kuh hai tai maten dow CHAKRAMANG enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai vüi kowmatia sak nau hown kowh maru uang pe mih chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />Maiawngün uanh dow Jerusalem kowi Thurai chup kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah towklak kowi kowtowm dowi mowr kaneuma khetah büa diah. Maiawngün uanh dow uamow lang kri miuüa, Leviuüa hai Israeluüa kowh chowlowkkow machak aluchowuüa kowi enni napeah kown, now naiawngün uanh maten dow amatni mih nakhaiah kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZR 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Nami kung kowi dow uamowuüa hai Leviuüa mih naiawngün khaiah mih kuh, tai hai puh bia aikam mih Jerusalem kowi kowh Thurai chup kim kowi nakowpawla kownkow paw büah khai.<verse eid="EZR 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi maru kawmuüa kowting mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />Now la uown kowi kowh laipre ni mih ni khe dow Ahava aw re-e kowh tangbung khupra hownia Jerusalem prakowi anging tarü khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Thurai dow tawi uowila anging reng chekhai, now aia dow tiama kowi ransu-uüa hai damrauüa rut hownia hen anging khai. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" />Naiawng hai Jerusalem kowi kowting now sum ni mowr nakowi anging tanai khai.<verse eid="EZR 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" />Now tali ni mih ni khe dow naiawngün kuh, tai hai puh bia aikam mih khaiah now Thurai chup kim kowi uamow Uria kowh chapa Meremawt rut kowi anging appe khai. Nakhowk khe Meremawt hown tawi uowi miuüa dow Finehas kowh chapa Eleazar, Jesua kowh chapa Jozabad hai Binui kowh chapa Noadia büah chekhai. Amatni dow Leviuüa kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />Nakhowk khe naiawngün uanh maten dow rüaah hai khaiah now mün khowt chow uowi mih chabowih kowi ruiah khai.<verse eid="EZR 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />Now cham takhangra hownia uang plan mih maru-uüa dow Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi chang tikah mih uanap pawi khai. Amatni dow Israel chen pachenma vüi chiala laipre pum, ruapurla 96 pum, ruapur chah 77 pum hai angak lawt lük müa ruala laipre pum pe büah khai. Naiawngün uanh maten dow CHAKRAMANG vüi changla tikah mih uanap kownkow pe mih kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" />Amatni dow Iufratis aw satkup pra kowh pren kruitown miuüa kowi Babulawn pren mang kowh ana pek krawi phowk pe khai. Nami ana pek tata hanow amatni dow maru-uüa kowi hai Thurai chup kim lup kowi tawi khowngah khai.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s">Akeng chenchap hown tachawng talang lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />Naiawngün lup ki changta bowk kung kowi Israel aluchowuüa uangah hanow tek ang mih, “Israeluüa, uamowuüa hai Leviuüa dow nami pren kowi kowh uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa hownia kowmatia kowi lang takra dowi. Amatni dow nakowi kowh Kananuüa, Hituüa, Perizuüa, Jebusuüa, Amawnuüa, Moabuüa, Aiguptauüa hai Amawruüa iawng suiiai kaniaima mih lup tawi chang büah khai. <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" />Israeluüa dow amatni hai amatni kowh chapauüa vüi naiawngün maru-uüa kowh chamauüa kowi changla masi kownkow pawah khai. Naiawng kaah sakowm dowi mih lup lang chang hu mih dow aluchowuüa hai maru iukuüa chekhai. Naiawng hai Israeluüa dow amatni kowh chimsaima mih chenchap kowi naiawngün akeng mih chenchapuüa hown tasür talawk büah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZR 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />Nami laiklow ang tata hanow nowm nowm ang sak piak khai. Naiawng rakowi ang khupah mih tawnguat dow ang thekta khai, now ang kowh sam hai mawmpawi ün khaita hanow amawlawma ang chowm phulu khai. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" />Naiawng hai sat kup khe kowh phuchua chang khin mowr pat amawlawma ang chowm khai. Nakhowk khe Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi Thurai laiklow kowi kram miuüa dow ang re-e uang takua talawm khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Babulawn pren kowi cham takhangra hownia kowh uang lawt miuüa dow kaah sakowm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" />Now sat kup khe kowh phuchua khin khe dow sak piak kowh ang chowm phulu mih hownia ang awr rü khai. Now atheknama mih tawnguat khupma hown ang tua kung khai, now CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai tut-e ang awr iaw rut se ang chup Thurai khai. <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" />Ang awr tek mih,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 9:6">“Aw ang kowh Thurai, en prakowi awr tau kown mih nowm nowm ang rukrai khai bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging dow nowm nowm changta angak khai. Nami angak dow anging lu kowi püt khai bowt; anging kowh aprek dow mukuang kowi pat ting khai bowt. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" />Anging pipu-uüa chowng hownia kawmat mowr kowi anging changta angak mih dow nowm nowm hu khai bowt. Anging, anging kowh manguüa hai anging kowh uamowuüa kowi akeng prenchak manguüa rut kowi ap anging mih dow anging kowh angak rakowi chekhai. Amatni dow anging kowh maru-uüa tawngbak mih kowi saita ün khai, tawngbak mih kowi khümla ün khai, dawngthawnguan ün pawla khai, now lainowmma pela anging rukrai büah khai. Anging dow kawmat paw naiawng chowreng tak chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" />“Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai dow khin nawngchow vüi saksing sana anging khai. Anging kowi dow en pe sing anging sangrum khai, now en kowh chimsaima mih pren kowi anikma mih uowi rah en pe anging khai. Naiawng hai anging kowh Thurai dow plan pe anging awmrawmra khai, now anging cham uowi nar mih hownia uang lawtla anging khai. <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" />Anging cham uowi nar chepaw anging kowh Thurai dow müta anging hüah dowi chekhai. En dow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura tüng anging reng chekhai. En dow Persia pren manguüa kowi nasaksing nasanala anging kown mih saktuak en peah khai. Anging kowi dow en kowh kim naia thawpla kownkow hai piak mih arah maten naia rawla kownkow en pe sing anging khai. Now Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi athaulangma en pe uowi anging khai.<verse eid="EZR 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />“Aw anging kowh Thurai, kawmat tawng chow anging natek en bowt kown? Anging vüi naiawng khowt en chang khowk chepaw en kowh alow pek dow anging nuata khai iawk. <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" />En kowh nar risiuüa kowi kowh en peah mih alow pek lawnguan kowi amatni tek anging mih, ‘Enni nakowpowngah kown mih pren dow nakowi kowh uowi miuüa asürlawkma rakowi tawi tasür talawk khai bowt. Amatni kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup rakowi pren paprenma dow hing tasür talawk khai bowt. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" />Naiawng rakowi enni kowh chamauüa kowi amatni kowh chapauüa hown hangkow pe tachawngah diah. Enni kowh chapauüa kowi paw amatni kowh chamauüa hown hangkow pe tachawngah diah. Amatni <char style="w">thaulang</char> müa hai iung müa ün tawngpaw hangkow chang pe büa diah. Naiawng che enni chün hanow enni nakür kown, pren kowi kowh aiung aiungma mih luprak enni naka cha kown, now chowngchowng saksakma vüi dawngthawnguan iawng hai pren dow enni kowh chauüa kowi enni naia apla kown towbowt,’ pape khai.<verse eid="EZR 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" />“Anging luk kowi naiawng ripra uang ting mih dow anging kowh lup ngak hu lai bowt rakowi chekhai. Aw anging kowh Thurai, anging changta lup ngak khowt en pe anging ripra dowi chekhai, now anging kowh maru-uüa kowi dow en pe singah ne tak chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" />Naiawng chepaw en kowh ana pek chün dowi kowi suiiai kaniaima mih lup chang mih maru-uüa hown anging plan tachawng iawk kown ü? Naiawng che anging chang hanow nowm nowm en nakunmarau anging kown. Nahanow en napiakta anging kown, now mia kowi paw en nape sing anging kown nadowi. <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" />Aw CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai, en dow achinawmma chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging dow ani mowr pat ta sing ne tak chekhai. Anging kowh angak dow en pur kowi anging uang taphuang khowk. Anging pungmadawng kowi dow en pur kowi naiowng kown mih miapaw tataing dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa taphuang angak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />Ezra dow Thurai chup kim pur kowi tabawk krawm now chup Thurai se amatni kowh angak taphuang hanow kar khai. Nakhowk khe Israeluüa maten dow masiuüa, kachakuüa, aiuk, asowm akawmma Ezra re-e uang takua talawm khai, now naiawngün maru kawmuüa paw lainowmma tawi kar khai. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" />Nakhowk khe Elam machak hownia Jehiel chapa Sekania tek pe Ezra mih, “A-i pungmadawng kowi akeng chenchap masiuüa kowi chawng mih uowi ne chekhai. Thurai kaah sakowm dowi iawng a-i uowi khai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat paw CHAKRAMANG kowh sakraura naka kown mih Israeluüa kowh sakowmra uowi tak. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" />Naiawng rakowi chu, a-i kowh Thurai pur kowi a-i takham diah sik. En kowh prengia pek iawng hai Thurai kowh ana pek kowi chün miuüa kowh prengia pek iawng a-i chang diah sik. A-i chawngah mih akeng chenchap masiuüa kowi hai chauüa kowi ari aiang kowi arui uowi iawng a-i khuata diah sik. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />Aw Ezra, naiawngün lup nachang kown mih dow en kowh kurdik chekhai. Naiawng rakowi sakkraingma hown chang diah; anging tawi khowng en kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="EZR 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" />Nakhowk khe Ezra dow awr rü hanow Sekania kowh laiklow iawng nachang kownkow uamowuüa, Leviuüa hai Thurai chup kim pur kowi kowh takua talawm mih Israeluüa maten kowi pe takhamah khai. Nahanow amatni dow saktuak akhawtma hown takham büah bowk khai. <verse eid="EZR 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />Nami kung kowi dow Ezra mih Thurai chup kim pur hownia powt hanow Eliasib kowh chapa Jehohanan kowh towklak kowi kowkowi khai. Now cham takhangra hownia kowh uang plan miuüa Thurai kaah sakowm dowi iawng uowi rakowi aia dow nami towklak kowi tawngpaw cha dowi kham dowi kowi kar hai nguk hown uowi khai.<verse eid="EZR 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7-8" />Now cham takhangra hownia kowh uang plan mih maten Jerusalem marow kowi nauang takua talawm kownkow Jerusalem marow hai Judauüa süng kowi kowh uowi mih maten kowi krawi phowng pe satang khai. Amatni dow sum ni mowr kowi Jerusalem kowi uang ia ting dowi mih maten kowi napawta pe dawngthawnguan bowk hanow cham takhangra hownia uang plan miuüa pungmadawng hownia nabatta kown mih krawi phuangla khai.<verse eid="EZR 10:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />Naiawng rakowi sum ni lak kowi Juda hai Benjamin süng kowi kowh maru maten mih Jerusalem marow kowi uang takua talawm khai. Naiawng amatni takua talawm mih dow taku la kowi kowh lacher pirmi ni khe chekhai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow Thurai chup kim pur kowi kowh viadawng kowi chowmla rim se nami lawnguan pankrima rakowi hai uangchak rakowi chürla kluk khai. <verse eid="EZR 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Nakhowk khe uamow Ezra awr iowngah hanow maru kawmuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Thurai kaah sakowm dowi iawng enni uowi khai. Israeluüa kowh akeng mih angak hown akeng chenchap masiuüa kowi enni paw mih angak paw enni uang bawngla khai. <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih CHAKRAMANG enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai tut-e taphuang angak büah hanow Thurai naukrang iawng chang büa diah. Enni pren kowi kowh uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa hai akeng chenchap masiuüa hawmh hownia lang takra büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EZR 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Nakhowk khe Ezra kowi atün atünma maru kawmuüa tek pe mih, “En tekah mih lainowmma iung; en tek iawng a-i nachang kown takla. <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Nachenganchepaw nami lup dow ani pre ni sang ia chur mih lup nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng mih lup ngak chang mih dow anging akawmma chekhai. Nami klen kowi kawmat dow uang paw chak mih nowm tak. Naiawng rakowi uat kowi anging nowng iowng dowi bowt. <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" />Nami lawnguan kowi tawng ngai chow achang takla mih anging kowh aluchowuüa pacham paw kurdik lah. Now anging chowlowkkow kua hai marow towng kowi kowh akeng chenchap masiuüa kowi chawng mih maten amatni kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa hai tara chet miuüa kowi pawla now khowm bowkta mih akhin khe Jerusalem marow kowi pauang lah. Nahanow nami angak rakowi kramra uowima mih Thurai kowh kunmaraura dow a-i hownia naprowng kown taih,” pakhai. <verse eid="EZR 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Nakhowk khe nami laiklow kowi üa mih dow Asahel kowh chapa Jonathan hai Tikva kowh chapa Jazeia iüah chekhai. Now amatchi kowi tawi tangila mih dow Mesulam hai Levi krungchak Sabethai iüah chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Now cham takhangra hownia kowh uang plan miuüa dow nami laiklow iawng chang khai bowt. Uamow Ezra mih krungchak towng hownia rui pe aluchow lowk ia chi khai. Now hamüt la kowi kowh lacher pani khe amatni dow nami akeng chenchap masiuüa kowi chawng miuüa kowh lawnguan kowi nachichet kownkow chowm khai bowt. <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />Nami chichetra lup maten churta büah mih dow auai ning kowi kowh la uown kowi lacher pani khe chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akeng chenchap masiuüa kowi chawng miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />Uamowuüa hownia akeng chenchap masiuüa kowi paw miuüa dow Jozadawk kowh chapa Jesua hai atainau-uüa kowh krungchak hownia Maseia, Eliezer, Jarib hai Gedalia büah chekhai. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" />Amatni dow kowmatia masi kowi nakhuata kown pami takham büah bowk khai, now amatni changta angak mih rakowi lowk ia e apum chi uang pawla ruapurla büah hanow chang angak lawt lük müa uanap pawi büah khai. <verse eid="EZR 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" />Akeng mih uamowuüa Imer krungchak hownia Hanani hai Zebadia iüah, <verse eid="EZR 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />Harim krungchak hownia Maseia, Elija, Semaia, Jehiel hai Uzia büah, <verse eid="EZR 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />Pasur krungchak hownia Eliawenai, Maseia, Ismael, Nethanel, Jozabad hai Elasa büah chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />Levi krungchak hownia akeng chenchap masiuüa kowi paw miuüa dow Jozabad, Simei, Kelaia (Kelita), Pethahia, Juda hai Eliezer büah. <verse eid="EZR 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />Meng sarauüa hownia dow Eliasib, now Kangchawng miuüa hownia dow Salum, Telem hai Uri büah chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Israeluüa hownia akeng chenchap masiuüa kowi paw miuüa dow Paraws krungchak Ramia, Izia, Malkija, Mijamin, Eleazar, Hasabia hai Benaia büah. <verse eid="EZR 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />Elam krungchak hownia Matania, Zekaria, Jehiel, Abdi, Jeremawt hai Elija büah. <verse eid="EZR 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />Zatu krungchak hownia Eliawenai, Eliasib, Matania, Jeremawt, Zabad hai Aziza büah. <verse eid="EZR 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />Bebai krungchak hownia Jehohanan, Hanani, Zabai hai Atlai büah. <verse eid="EZR 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />Bani krungchak hownia Mesulam, Maluk, Adaia, Jasub, Seal hai Jeremawt büah. <verse eid="EZR 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />Pahat-Moab krungchak hownia Adna, Kelal, Benaia, Maseia, Matania, Bezalel, Binui hai Manase büah. <verse eid="EZR 10:30" /><verse number="31-32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31-32" />Harim krungchak hownia Eliezer, Isija, Malkija, Semaia, Simiawn, Benjamin, Maluk hai Semaria büah. <verse eid="EZR 10:31-32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />Hasum krungchak hownia Matenai, Matata, Zabad, Elifelet, Jeremai, Manase hai Simei büah. <verse eid="EZR 10:33" /><verse number="34-37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34-37" />Bani krungchak hownia Madai, Amram, Uel, Benaia, Bedeia, Keluhi, Vania, Meremawt, Eliasib, Matania, Matenai hai Jasu büah. <verse eid="EZR 10:34-37" /><verse number="38-42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38-42" />Binui krungchak hownia Simei, Selemia, Nathan, Adaia, Maknadebai, Sasai, Sarai, Azarel, Selemia, Semaria, Salum, Amaria hai Josef büah. <verse eid="EZR 10:38-42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />Nebo krungchak hownia Jeiel, Matithia, Zabad, Zebina, Jadai, Joel hai Benaia büah.<verse eid="EZR 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" />Amatni dow akeng chenchap masiuüa kowi chawng mih kangowh chekhai, now tawngbak mih kowh masi dow chauüa paw uowi ne chekhai.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>